+# talk_speed.txt - the Talk screen's windows on the GBA, added by speed audit 4 (docs/design/SPEED_AUDIT4.md):
+# SCENE_TALK (core/src/talk_scene.c) in a conversation as talk.txt plays it: the menu, a cursor move, the Chat
+# list, the press that makes the answer, the answer box (DIALOG over the Talk screen) and the menu after a reply.
+# Window rules: speed2_fair.txt (`fps start` .. `fps LABEL`; talk.txt's own `fps` lines span the whole script
+# before them, not a window). Not a speed2_ group: the PS1 has no Talk screen yet and the Dreamcast's Talk group
+# is dc/tests/talk/speed2_talk.txt (TD3, the bank from the disc). Run:
+#   gba/build/harness gba/build/doomogachi.gba --script gba/harness/scripts/talk_speed.txt --no-fps-gates \
+#       --worklog --quiet > LOG; python3 tools/speed2.py table LOG
+# talk.txt's pinned seed 18 (the resident's lines follow the town seed).
+wait 40
+expect-log doomo: init
+sync on 61
+
+# ---- Talk: a conversation (push TALK 1 after the premade island moved in, as talk.txt) ----
+# Pushed straight from the title the resident opens with no line: the menu comes first.
+seed 18
+scene TITLE
+wait 10
+push HOME 3
+wait 20
+press B
+wait 20
+expect-scene TITLE
+push TALK 1
+wait 40
+expect-scene TALK
+fps start
+wait 90
+fps talk: menu
+shot sa4_talk_menu
+press DOWN
+wait 2
+fps start
+wait 30
+fps talk: menu cursor move
+press DOWN
+wait 4
+press DOWN
+wait 4
+press DOWN
+wait 4
+fps start
+press A
+wait 30
+fps talk: chat list open
+shot sa4_talk_chat
+fps start
+wait 60
+fps talk: chat list
+fps start
+press A
+wait 20
+fps talk: reply press (the answer is made)
+expect-scene DIALOG
+fps start
+wait 40
+fps talk: answer box
+shot sa4_talk_answer
+press A
+wait 40
+expect-scene TALK
+fps start
+wait 90
+fps talk: menu after a reply
+shot sa4_talk_after
+
+# ---- Talk from a house visit: walk up to the host and press A (talk.txt section 1) ---------------
+seed 18
+scene TITLE
+wait 10
+push HOME 3
+wait 60
+hold DOWN 24
+hold LEFT 14
+fps start
+press A
+wait 30
+fps talk: house visit, the press that opens Talk (the greeting is made)
+expect-scene DIALOG
+fps start
+wait 60
+fps talk: house visit greeting box
